---
import CommentLabel from "@/components/ui/CommentLabel.astro";
---

<div class="panel-inner">
  <CommentLabel text="event_info" />

  <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-ink text-glow-primary mt-3 leading-tight">
    LATENT<br />2026
  </h2>
  <p class="font-mono text-accent-500 text-sm mt-1 tracking-widest">// 學生專題社展</p>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
    <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
      <span class="text-ink-disabled shrink-0 w-16">DATE</span>
      <span class="text-ink">2026 / 05 / 31 (日)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
      <span class="text-ink-disabled shrink-0 w-16">TIME</span>
      <span class="text-ink">09:00 — 18:00</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
      <span class="text-ink-disabled shrink-0 w-16">VENUE</span>
      <div>
        <p class="text-ink">建國中學 夢紅樓藝廊</p>
        <p class="text-ink-dim text-xs mt-0.5">台北市中正區南海路 56 號</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-6 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs">
    <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
      <span class="text-accent-500">✦</span>
      <span class="text-ink-dim">主辦</span>
      <span class="text-ink">建中電子研究社 × 北一女資訊研究社</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
      <span class="text-line-active">◆</span>
      <span class="text-ink-dim">協辦</span>
      <span class="text-ink-muted">建中資訊社、成功電研、中山資研、景美電腦</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
    LATENT，取自「潛伏的能量」。每一年，來自不同領域的學生在這裡展示他們的作品——
    那些還沒被世界發現、但已悄悄成形的創作。
  </p>
</div>
